      "start": 23.307,
      "duration": 2.436
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Let's start off with this Bug Amber Dig Kit.​ ​​",
      "start": 25.743,
      "duration": 2.936
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Being sold by GobiDex.​ ​​",
      "start": 28.679,
      "duration": 1.702
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​NOT SPONSORED​ ​​",
      "start": 28.679,
      "duration": 1.702
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Behold this stylish box​ ​​",
      "start": 30.381,
      "duration": 2.002
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​and the way it rotates via slow motion.​ ​​",
      "start": 32.383,
      "duration": 2.168
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​So fancy.​ ​​",
      "start": 34.551,
      "duration": 1.068
    },
    {
