    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​with me as a size comparison?​ ​​",
      "start": 37.855,
      "duration": 1.935
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​This is huge!​ ​​",
      "start": 39.79,
      "duration": 1.401
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I absolutely adore​ ​​\n​​ ​these educational knick-knacks.​ ​​",
      "start": 41.191,
      "duration": 3.003
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I actually have quite a few of them.​ ​​",
      "start": 44.194,
      "duration": 1.569
