    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I also just really like looking at bugs.​ ​​",
      "start": 45.763,
      "duration": 2.669
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​So does this cat.​ ​​",
      "start": 48.432,
      "duration": 1.034
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Don't get me wrong.​ ​​",
      "start": 49.466,
      "duration": 1.001
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​They're gross and repulsive up close,​ ​​",
      "start": 50.467,
      "duration": 2.303
    },
    {
