      "start": 52.77,
      "duration": 2.002
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​There's just so many​ ​​\n​​ ​miniature details on them​ ​​",
      "start": 54.772,
      "duration": 1.935
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​that you can't see with the naked eye.​ ​​",
      "start": 56.707,
      "duration": 1.802
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Inside the package are​ ​​\n​​ ​three digging essentials,​ ​​",
      "start": 58.509,
      "duration": 3.203
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​and we get some safety goggles.​ ​​",
      "start": 61.712,
      "duration": 2.369
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​For your eyes.​ ​​",
      "start": 64.081,
      "duration": 1.301
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​And a handy dandy magnifying lens.​ ​​",
      "start": 65.382,
      "duration": 2.703
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​To see my shame.​ ​​",
      "start": 68.085,
      "duration": 1.768
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Is it here?​ ​​",
      "start": 69.853,
      "duration": 1.068
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​The rest of the product is the plaster​ ​​",
      "start": 72.756,
      "duration": 2.102
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​which would have​ ​​\n​​ ​the artificial resin for the insects.​ ​​",
      "start": 74.858,
      "duration": 3.103
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​As an educational background​ ​​\n​​ ​of what bugs there are,​ ​​",
      "start": 77.961,
      "duration": 2.67
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I chose not to look​ ​​\n​​ ​at this until the end of this.​ ​​",
      "start": 80.631,
      "duration": 2.903
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​So I'm going to be surprised​ ​​\n​​ ​for what we find.​ ​​",
      "start": 83.534,
      "duration": 3.236
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​First step is to prepare the work station.​ ​​",
      "start": 86.77,
      "duration": 2.069
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​So I've prepared a bowl of water​ ​​",
      "start": 88.839,
      "duration": 1.802
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​in order to soften the plaster.​ ​​",
      "start": 90.641,
      "duration": 3.003
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I tried to organize as much as I can,​ ​​",
      "start": 93.644,
      "duration": 2.002
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​and then I opened up the tools.​ ​​",
      "start": 95.646,
      "duration": 1.768
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​In here, we have a little chisel.​ ​​",
      "start": 97.414,
      "duration": 2.336
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​As the name implies,​ ​​",
      "start": 99.75,
      "duration": 1.335
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​this chisels things.​ ​​",
      "start": 101.085,
      "duration": 2.535
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Secondly, we also have​ ​​\n​​ ​a \"handy\" little brush.​ ​​",
      "start": 103.62,
      "duration": 3.604
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​It gives you high fives,​ ​​",
      "start": 107.224,
      "duration": 1.602
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​and also sweeps away your crime.​ ​​",
      "start": 108.826,
      "duration": 2.636
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​So it's good for cleanup.​ ​​",
      "start": 111.462,
      "duration": 1.267
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Sweep, sweep, sweep.​ ​​",
      "start": 112.729,
      "duration": 1.836
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​And the final tool: a little mallet​ ​​",
      "start": 114.565,
      "duration": 2.302
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​that doubles as a weapon.​ ​​",
      "start": 116.867,
      "duration": 2.202
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​So you can stab things with it.​ ​​",
      "start": 119.837,
      "duration": 1.835
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​So now we are all prepared​ ​​\n​​ ​for our excavation.​ ​​",
      "start": 121.672,
      "duration": 2.903
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​But don't forget your​ ​​\n​​ ​safety goggles and your lens.​ ​​",
      "start": 124.575,
      "duration": 2.569
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​And at last, we can finally get started.​ ​​",
      "start": 127.711,
      "duration": 2.503
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Using my weapon!​ ​​",
      "start": 130.214,
      "duration": 2.402
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​(Manager) Shiori, no​ ​​",
      "start": 132.616,
      "duration": 1.068
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​(Shiori Novella) Oh​ ​​",
      "start": 133.684,
      "duration": 0.367
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Using this tool,​ ​​",
      "start": 134.651,
      "duration": 2.002
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I delicately removed​ ​​\n​​ ​the plastic off the plaster brick.​ ​​",
      "start": 136.653,
      "duration": 4.171
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​It was a very tense situation.​ ​​",
      "start": 140.824,
      "duration": 2.636
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​But I managed to do it​ ​​\n​​ ​at 100% success rate.​ ​​",
      "start": 143.46,
      "duration": 3.57
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Thankfully, there is nothing complex​ ​​\n​​ ​about this project.​ ​​",
      "start": 147.03,
      "duration": 3.437
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​After the removal of its plastic skin,​ ​​",
      "start": 150.467,
      "duration": 2.97
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​it's easy going from here,​ ​​\n​​ ​although quite messy.​ ​​",
      "start": 153.437,
      "duration": 3.303
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​So we just have to​ ​​\n​​ ​moisturize multiple times,​ ​​",
      "start": 156.74,
      "duration": 3.07
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​and use these three tools​ ​​",
      "start": 159.81,
      "duration": 2.269
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​to dig open its insides.​ ​​",
      "start": 162.079,
      "duration": 3.236
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​You'll have to forgive me for my...​ ​​",
      "start": 165.315,
      "duration": 1.969
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​preferred use of vocabulary.​ ​​",
      "start": 167.284,
      "duration": 2.636
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I get kind of excited sometimes.​ ​​",
      "start": 169.92,
      "duration": 3.237
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Man, okay, so...​ ​​",
      "start": 173.157,
      "duration": 1.034
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​When I was younger,​ ​​\n​​ ​my dad had a bunch of​ ​​",
      "start": 174.191,
      "duration": 3.27
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​artifacts around the house.​ ​​",
      "start": 177.461,
      "duration": 2.269
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​And they looked so fancy to little old me.​ ​​",
      "start": 179.73,
      "duration": 2.836
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​There was a Buddha statue,​ ​​",
      "start": 182.566,
      "duration": 1.902
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​and supposedly there was​ ​​\n​​ ​a gem somewhere,​ ​​",
      "start": 184.468,
      "duration": 1.868
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​but I didn't find that.​ ​​",
      "start": 186.336,
      "duration": 1.635
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​And papa Shiori told me that​ ​​\n​​ ​he used to be an archeologist,​ ​​",
      "start": 187.971,
      "duration": 6.273
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​and he would dig around in Egypt.​ ​​",
      "start": 194.244,
      "duration": 2.903
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​So I was so excited to hear that.​ ​​",
      "start": 197.147,
      "duration": 1.902
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I was like, wow!​ ​​",
      "start": 199.049,
      "duration": 1.235
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​My daddy is an archeologist?​ ​​",
      "start": 200.284,
      "duration": 2.235
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​That sounds so cool.​ ​​",
      "start": 202.519,
      "duration": 1.135
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I can't wait to tell everyone​ ​​\n​​ ​for Show And Tell.​ ​​",
      "start": 203.654,
      "duration": 2.636
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​But then one day...​ ​​",
      "start": 206.29,
      "duration": 1.635
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​This was years later after that fact.​ ​​",
      "start": 207.925,
      "duration": 2.202
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Years way down the road,​ ​​",
      "start": 210.127,
      "duration": 1.868
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I was playing in the garage,​ ​​",
      "start": 211.995,
      "duration": 1.835
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​just kind of looking at all the junk collected.​ ​​",
      "start": 213.83,
      "duration": 3.437
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​It was also his man cave, I suppose.​ ​​",
      "start": 217.267,
      "duration": 2.77
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Anyway, I looked at below the items,​ ​​",
      "start": 220.037,
      "duration": 3.503
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​and it said \"Made in ***\",​ ​​",
      "start": 223.54,
      "duration": 1.368
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​and let's just say I felt like he betrayed me.​ ​​",
      "start": 224.908,
      "duration": 4.538
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​It's like, my childhood was​ ​​\n​​ ​just ruined in one fell swoop.​ ​​",
      "start": 229.846,
      "duration": 4.472
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​So that was... That was a thing.​ ​​",
      "start": 234.318,
      "duration": 2.636
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Worry not, these tears are not because​ ​​\n​​ ​of that tidbit about my childhood.​ ​​",
      "start": 242.326,
      "duration": 4.504
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​What am I...​ ​​\n​​ ​What am I supposed to do with this?​ ​​",
      "start": 247.931,
      "duration": 3.037
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Maybe like this?​ ​​",
      "start": 250.968,
      "duration": 1.268
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​It is simply because my gloves​ ​​\n​​ ​have gotten dirty.​ ​​",
      "start": 252.236,
      "duration": 3.069
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I've not found any bugs.​ ​​",
      "start": 255.305,
      "duration": 1.635
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Unless I'm doing, like, a horrible job​ ​​\n​​ ​and I ended up destroying it completely.​ ​​",
      "start": 256.94,
      "duration": 4.004
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​In which case, I certainly hope not.​ ​​",
      "start": 261.345,
      "duration": 1.835
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Perhaps...​ ​​",
      "start": 264.348,
      "duration": 0.6
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​There's something here!​ ​​",
      "start": 266.583,
      "duration": 1.535
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Okay, let's try and keep this very deli-​ ​​",
      "start": 268.652,
      "duration": 3.537
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Oh, there you go, I'm done.​ ​​",
      "start": 272.189,
      "duration": 1.134
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Oh! We will look at this later.​ ​​",
      "start": 274.658,
      "duration": 2.336
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I don't know what it is.​ ​​",
      "start": 276.994,
      "duration": 1.735
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​It looks pretty cool, though.​ ​​",
      "start": 278.729,
      "duration": 1.701
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Voila. The first sign of progress,​ ​​",
      "start": 280.43,
      "duration": 2.736
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​and I was still trying to ensure that​ ​​\n​​ ​I didn't miss any tiny bug ambers.​ ​​",
      "start": 283.166,
      "duration": 5.005
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​But now that I knew how big it was,​ ​​",
      "start": 288.171,
      "duration": 2.269
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​it was actually kind of easy to find the rest.​ ​​",
      "start": 290.44,
      "duration": 2.403
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​And I was so excited.​ ​​",
      "start": 292.843,
      "duration": 2.135
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​For insects!​ ​​",
      "start": 294.978,
      "duration": 0.734
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Nothing?​ ​​",
      "start": 296.013,
      "duration": 0.8
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Nothing. Okay.​ ​​",
      "start": 297.281,
      "duration": 1.868
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I don't know how​ ​​\n​​ ​I'm gonna clean this table later.​ ​​",
      "start": 299.149,
      "duration": 2.236
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I'm assuming there's nothing in here.​ ​​",
      "start": 303.887,
      "duration": 2.236
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Okay...​ ​​",
      "start": 307.057,
      "duration": 0.901
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​There ain't anything.​ ​​",
      "start": 307.958,
      "duration": 1.234
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Man, actually, you know what​ ​​\n​​ ​would've been smart?​ ​​",
      "start": 309.192,
      "duration": 2.636
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​You know, I was wondering...​ ​​",
      "start": 311.828,
      "duration": 1.101
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​If I just did this in a bucket of water​ ​​",
      "start": 312.929,
      "duration": 3.637
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​and then I broke it in the end,​ ​​",
      "start": 316.566,
      "duration": 1.469
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I imagine it'd be so much easier then.​ ​​",
      "start": 318.035,
      "duration": 3.203
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​But that's not the spirit of this.​ ​​",
      "start": 322.773,
      "duration": 2.836
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Not the spirit of my fun​ ​​\n​​ ​and educational video.​ ​​",
      "start": 325.609,
      "duration": 5.005
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Oh my gosh.​ ​​",
      "start": 331.548,
      "duration": 1.568
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​This is going to turn into a cleaning-​ ​​",
      "start": 333.116,
      "duration": 1.435
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Aah!​ ​​",
      "start": 334.551,
      "duration": 1.502
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Cleaning segment later.​ ​​",
      "start": 336.053,
      "duration": 1.801
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Oh nyo, my cat!​ ​​",
      "start": 337.854,
      "duration": 2.036
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​My cat got covered in mush.​ ​​",
      "start": 339.89,
      "duration": 1.968
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I might as well go all in.​ ​​",
      "start": 344.494,
      "duration": 1.702
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​That's right.​ ​​",
      "start": 347.597,
      "duration": 1.469
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​We're going in!​ ​​",
      "start": 349.933,
      "duration": 1.335
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Oh, that looks cool.​ ​​",
      "start": 351.268,
      "duration": 1.401
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Okay, this is three out of... something?​ ​​",
      "start": 353.637,
      "duration": 3.303
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​How many bugs are in here?​ ​​",
      "start": 356.94,
      "duration": 1.902
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I shouldn't spoil myself,​ ​​",
      "start": 360.177,
      "duration": 1.368
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​even though I'm sure​ ​​\n​​ ​I saw a picture of something.​ ​​",
      "start": 361.545,
      "duration": 3.87
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Anything? I doubt it.​ ​​",
      "start": 365.415,
      "duration": 1.302
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I'm just gonna... Oh, you know what?​ ​​",
      "start": 366.717,
      "duration": 1.768
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​You know what?​ ​​",
      "start": 368.485,
      "duration": 1.034
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Here...​ ​​",
      "start": 369.519,
      "duration": 0.835
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​The easiest way to go about this​ ​​",
      "start": 371.088,
      "duration": 2.736
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​is to actually leave it in here.​ ​​",
      "start": 373.824,
      "duration": 2.402
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I feel something here.​ ​​",
      "start": 377.794,
      "duration": 1.569
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Yeah!​ ​​",
      "start": 380.297,
      "duration": 1.068
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Gosh. This room was clean before.​ ​​",
      "start": 384.267,
      "duration": 4.271
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I cleaned- Oh, that looks cool.​ ​​",
      "start": 388.538,
      "duration": 2.436
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I cleaned everything up.​ ​​",
      "start": 391.675,
      "duration": 1.702
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Everything was well prepared. Organized.​ ​​",
      "start": 394.211,
      "duration": 3.003
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​And now it's just hot, stuffy and dirty!​ ​​",
      "start": 397.214,
      "duration": 3.303
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Just like jail.​ ​​",
      "start": 401.418,
      "duration": 1.435
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Oh, I don't know what this is.​ ​​",
      "start": 403.82,
      "duration": 1.035
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Is this all of it?​ ​​",
      "start": 404.855,
      "duration": 1.201
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I need to know.​ ​​",
      "start": 406.79,
      "duration": 1.068
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Otherwise I'll be wasting my time.​ ​​",
      "start": 407.858,
      "duration": 1.501
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Okay, no, spirit of archeology.​ ​​",
      "start": 409.359,
      "duration": 2.302
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​We must continue looking.​ ​​",
      "start": 411.661,
      "duration": 1.669
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Just stab until you can't stab no more.​ ​​",
      "start": 414.131,
      "duration": 3.136
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Oh, hey, there is one more.​ ​​",
      "start": 417.267,
      "duration": 2.069
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Nice! Naisu.​ ​​",
      "start": 420.837,
      "duration": 2.102
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I feel like this is it.​ ​​",
      "start": 425.742,
      "duration": 1.669
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​See, they told me the amount​ ​​\n​​ ​of insects there'd be.​ ​​",
      "start": 429.079,
      "duration": 3.403
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​So now that I know,​ ​​\n​​ ​what's the point of continuing?​ ​​",
      "start": 432.482,
      "duration": 3.304
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Look at this mess.​ ​​",
      "start": 435.786,
      "duration": 1.601
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​It used to be a happy sugar life.​ ​​",
      "start": 437.387,
      "duration": 2.136
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Now it's just... sugar.​ ​​",
      "start": 439.523,
      "duration": 2.535
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Unhappy sugar life.​ ​​",
      "start": 442.058,
      "duration": 1.969
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​How do I end my recording​ ​​\n​​ ​without touching my phone?​ ​​",
      "start": 444.027,
      "duration": 2.836
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Do I use my tongue?​ ​​",
      "start": 446.863,
      "duration": 1.602
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Is there any part of my body...​ ​​",
      "start": 449.366,
      "duration": 2.469
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​preferably within my hands, that is clean?​ ​​",
      "start": 451.835,
      "duration": 3.17
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​...​ ​​",
      "start": 455.005,
      "duration": 1.601
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Tongue it is!​ ​​",
      "start": 456.606,
      "duration": 1.602
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​At long last,​ ​​\n​​ ​the quest to find the bugs is complete.​ ​​",
      "start": 458.675,
      "duration": 5.005
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​And now it's just a matter of cleaning up​ ​​",
      "start": 463.68,
      "duration": 2.269
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​and reading the cards on what types​ ​​\n​​ ​of insects we've uncovered today.​ ​​",
      "start": 465.949,
      "duration": 3.737
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I've also taken the liberty of​ ​​\n​​ ​exchanging my dirty pair of gloves​ ​​",
      "start": 469.686,
      "duration": 3.537
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​for a new set! Here's purple!​ ​​",
      "start": 473.223,
      "duration": 2.636
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​I got tons of these.​ ​​",
      "start": 476.493,
      "duration": 1.802
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​With the fruits of our labors upon us,​ ​​",
      "start": 478.295,
      "duration": 1.801
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​it is now time to identify​ ​​\n​​ ​these little bug creatures.​ ​​",
      "start": 480.096,
      "duration": 4.271
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​So going from left to right,​ ​​",
      "start": 484.367,
      "duration": 1.602
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​we're going to begin​ ​​\n​​ ​with the Spiny Orb-Weaver.​ ​​",
      "start": 485.969,
      "duration": 2.569
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​These are generally harmless.​ ​​\n​​ ​They rarely bite.​ ​​",
      "start": 488.538,
      "duration": 3.237
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Unless you magically​ ​​\n​​ ​piss them off somehow.​ ​​",
      "start": 491.775,
      "duration": 2.803
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​If it has a brightly colored shell,​ ​​",
      "start": 494.578,
      "duration": 2.002
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​most likely it is a female Orb-Weaver.​ ​​",
      "start": 496.58,
      "duration": 2.802
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​But they only live for one year.​ ​​",
      "start": 499.382,
      "duration": 1.602
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​And they tend to appear​ ​​\n​​ ​around October to November.​ ​​",
      "start": 500.984,
      "duration": 3.403
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Generally speaking, insects​ ​​\n​​ ​don't live that long anyway,​ ​​",
      "start": 504.387,
      "duration": 3.07
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​so I really should not be surprised,​ ​​",
      "start": 507.457,
      "duration": 2.336
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​but I get a little bit sad for them sometimes.​ ​​",
      "start": 509.793,
      "duration": 3.203
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​This one here is essentially a ladybug,​ ​​",
      "start": 515.065,
      "duration": 3.47
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​or in scientific terms,​ ​​",
      "start": 518.535,
      "duration": 2.035
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​a \"Coccinellidae\" or \"Coccinellidee.\"​ ​​",
      "start": 520.57,
      "duration": 3.704
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​At least I hope I pronounced it correctly.​ ​​",
      "start": 524.274,
      "duration": 2.836
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​They're good for your garden​ ​​\n​​ ​and they're herbivores.​ ​​",
      "start": 527.11,
      "duration": 2.97
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Hopefully you know a lot more​ ​​\n​​ ​about ladybugs, though.​ ​​",
      "start": 530.08,
      "duration": 3.336
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Oh, one fun fact, though:​ ​​",
      "start": 534.818,
      "duration": 2.002
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​they eat their eggs.​ ​​",
      "start": 536.82,
      "duration": 1.334
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​So that's... that's kinda cool.​ ​​",
      "start": 538.154,
      "duration": 1.836
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​It's pretty hardcore, but hey, that's neat.​ ​​",
      "start": 539.99,
      "duration": 3.336
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​This is a cotton stainer,​ ​​",
      "start": 543.86,
      "duration": 1.602
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​known as Pyrrhocoridae/Pyrrhocoridey,​ ​​",
      "start": 545.462,
      "duration": 3.303
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​and you'll mostly find them​ ​​\n​​ ​in the mythical land of Florida.​ ​​",
      "start": 548.765,
      "duration": 3.771
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​If it's hot, humid, and particularly moist,​ ​​",
      "start": 552.536,
      "duration": 3.303
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​you'll most likely find them​ ​​\n​​ ​in places that exhibit those traits.​ ​​",
      "start": 555.839,
      "duration": 4.171
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​This is an Asian hornet.​ ​​",
      "start": 560.01,
      "duration": 2.135
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Although what my card omits is that​ ​​",
      "start": 562.145,
      "duration": 2.035
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​this is this actually​ ​​\n​​ ​an Asian *giant* hornet, I think.​ ​​",
      "start": 564.18,
      "duration": 4.739
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​They are one of the largest​ ​​\n​​ ​wasp species in the world.​ ​​",
      "start": 568.919,
      "duration": 3.436
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Not particularly friendly.​ ​​",
      "start": 572.355,
      "duration": 1.769
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Most likely to make you unalive​ ​​\n​​ ​if it stings you.​ ​​",
      "start": 574.124,
      "duration": 2.936
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​And they can destroy​ ​​\n​​ ​a swarm of honey bees.​ ​​",
      "start": 577.06,
      "duration": 3.003
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Those poor honey-sucking bees.​ ​​",
      "start": 580.063,
      "duration": 2.569
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​This is, I am sure​ ​​\n​​ ​you're aware of, a scorpion.​ ​​",
      "start": 582.632,
      "duration": 4.038
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​You have seen it in Animal Crossing.​ ​​",
      "start": 586.67,
      "duration": 1.801
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​It chases you menacingly when​ ​​\n​​ ​you are simply walking about with your net.​ ​​",
      "start": 588.471,
      "duration": 5.206
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​It has been around​ ​​\n​​ ​since the age of dinosaurs,​ ​​",
      "start": 593.677,
      "duration": 2.736
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​and it can eradicate its prey with its pincers.​ ​​",
      "start": 596.413,
      "duration": 3.27
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Last but not least, the rose chafer.​ ​​",
      "start": 599.683,
      "duration": 2.736
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Or the \"Cetonia Aurata.\"​ ​​",
      "start": 602.419,
      "duration": 1.735
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​They are summer beetles,​ ​​\n​​ ​and after they mate,​ ​​",
      "start": 604.154,
      "duration": 2.702
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​once the females lay the egg,​ ​​",
      "start": 606.856,
      "duration": 2.203
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​they just go kaput.​ ​​",
      "start": 609.059,
      "duration": 2.068
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​They live for about two years,​ ​​",
      "start": 611.127,
      "duration": 1.802
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​and they like to crawl on​ ​​\n​​ ​your little legs if you let them.​ ​​",
      "start": 612.929,
      "duration": 4.705
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​And they're also poisonous.​ ​​",
      "start": 617.634,
      "duration": 1.902
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​If you eat them.​ ​​",
      "start": 619.536,
      "duration": 1.234
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​So don't eat them.​ ​​",
      "start": 620.77,
      "duration": 1.235
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Four days later,​ ​​\n​​ ​I have finally finished this video,​ ​​",
      "start": 624.24,
      "duration": 3.571
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​and I hope you thoroughly​ ​​\n​​ ​enjoyed this story.​ ​​",
      "start": 627.811,
      "duration": 2.969
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Now, I hope to see you all next time​ ​​",
      "start": 630.78,
      "duration": 3.07
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​for whatever fun, quirky video I make.​ ​​",
      "start": 633.85,
      "duration": 3.203
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​So!​ ​​",
      "start": 637.053,
      "duration": 1.035
    },
    {
      "text": "​​​ ​Shiori~n!​ ​​",
      "start": 638.088,
      "duration": 2.102
    }
  ]
}
